blurb: The South Portland Board of Education met to discuss preparations for the upcoming
  school year, highlighting updates on athletic facilities, enrollment trends, and
  the implementation of the new personal electronic devices policy. The board also
  reviewed community feedback on elementary reconfiguration and approved the comprehensive
  emergency management plan.
